// Bagian 10, penutup.
//
// Sengaja TIDAK menyebut status pencarian kerja maupun tanggal kelulusan.
// Penutup ini menggambarkan cara kerja, bukan keadaan sesaat, supaya
// halamannya tidak basi begitu keadaan itu berubah.
//
// Ketiga contoh yang disebut semuanya nyata dan ada di halaman ini:
// kebocoran dataset, kunci jawaban yang salah menilai, dan website HIMATIF
// yang diarahkan tapi tidak ditulis sendiri.
//
// Nomor telepon tidak ditayangkan.
---

<section class="section close" id="contact" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="section__label">In closing</span>
    <h2 id="closing-title" class="rise">The through line</h2>

    <div class="close__grid">
      <div class="close__text rise">
        <p class="close__line">
          Most of this page is a record of checking things.
        </p>
        <p>
          A dataset that turned out to be contaminated. An answer key that
          marked correct answers wrong. A website I directed but did not write,
          and said so on the page rather than hoping nobody asked.
        </p>
        <p>
          Not one of those checks made a number larger. What they did was leave
          me with numbers I can still stand behind when someone asks how they
          were produced. That is the habit I would want you to take from here,
          more than any single result above it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="close__links rise">
        <a class="close__mail" href="mailto:dwiiyudaaa@gmail.com">
          dwiiyudaaa@gmail.com
        </a>
        <ul class="close__list">
          <li>
            <a class="figure" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dwiyuda"
              >linkedin.com/in/dwiyuda</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a class="figure" href="https://github.com/Dwiyuda"
              >github.com/Dwiyuda</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="caption close__where">Pekanbaru, Riau, Indonesia</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

